source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: Jira swallows a closing bracket into the autolinked URL, so it does not end one.
-- input.jira --
{{http://example.com]a}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt><a href="http://example.com]a" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">http://example.com]a</a></tt></p>
-- want.md --
`http://example.com]a`
-- warnings.json --
[]
